# M8. Divergence while holding: something pushes the left elbow 25° away from its goal. After 300 ms the Pi
# latches feedback_divergence and the arm goes compliant: every joint's torque limit drops to 25% (no grasp is
# active, so the gripper too).
expect motion mode ready
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key push-left
expect motion fault feedback_divergence arm_left elbow_flex
expect motion comply arm_left
key inspect-left
expect sim left follower torque=1,1,1,1,1,1 limit=250,250,250,250,250,250
# A compliant arm moves nothing until its torque is turned on again.
key push-left
key operator-clear
wait 2100
key c
expect motion cleared all faults
key pose-ready-left
expect motion command arm.go_to_pose refused:torque_off operator_cli
key q
